     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Pablo,<div><br></div><div>Are you trying to estimate abundance or occurrence probability? The definition of detection probability is context specific. It would also be nice to know how you sampled (number of sites, replicate observations, distance data?, etc..)... but unfortunately, even with this info there is no golden rule. You generally need to do a simulation study to determine the level of precision you might expect for a given sample size.</div>\r\n<div><br></div><div>Richard<br></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Wed, Feb 13, 2013 at 12:20 PM, Pablo <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">pcol...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br>\r\n<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">Dear Unmarked Group,<div><br></div><div>I conducted a bird survey in Micronesia and I would like to compare my data to a previous study. </div>\r\n<div>I would like to generate detection probabilities in three different strata (mangrove, below 200 meters of elevation and above 200 meters). I was wondering if the minimal number of detections  (~60) is the total number of detections or if I need 60 detections in each strata.</div>\r\n<div>I will appreciate any help in this matter.</div><div>Pablo</div><div><br></div><div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n </font></span><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n\r\n</font></span><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"520\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:520pt\">\r\n\r\n <colgroup><col width=\"65\" span=\"8\" style=\"width:65pt\">\r\n </colgroup><tbody><tr height=\"15\" style=\"min-height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"15\" width=\"65\" style=\"min-height:15.0pt;width:65pt\"></td>\r\n  <td width=\"65\" style=\"width:65pt\"></td>\r\n  <td colspan=\"3\" width=\"195\" style=\"width:195pt\">NUMBER\r\n  OF DETECTIONS 1994</td>\r\n  <td width=\"65\" style=\"width:65pt\"></td>\r\n  <td colspan=\"2\" width=\"130\" style=\"width:130pt\">NUMBER\r\n  OF DETECTIONS 2012</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"min-height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"min-height:15.0pt\"></td>\r\n  <td>MANGROVE</td>\r\n  <td>0-200</td>\r\n  <td>200-800</td>\r\n  <td></td>\r\n  <td>MANGROVE</td>\r\n  <td>0-200</td>\r\n  <td>200-800</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"min-height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"min-height:15.0pt\">NOODY SP.</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">51</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">72</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">73</td>\r\n  <td></td>\r\n  <td>20</td>\r\n  <td>34</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">22</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"min-height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"min-height:15.0pt\">BFPA</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">9</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0</td>\r\n  <td></td>\r\n  <td>0</td>\r\n  <td>4</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"min-height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"min-height:15.0pt\">CICA</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">1</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">7</td>\r\n  <td></td>\r\n  <td>2</td>\r\n  <td>2</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">4</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"min-height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"min-height:15.0pt\">CIGD</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">3</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">2</td>\r\n  <td></td>\r\n  <td>0</td>\r\n  <td>3</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">2</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"min-height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"min-height:15.0pt\">CIRW</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">53</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">24</td>\r\n  <td></td>\r\n  <td>0</td>\r\n  <td>1</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">4</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"min-height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"min-hei